WEBVTT

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.240
Hometown Clubhouse Hall - Akiba

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.370
Your music today was once again beautiful!

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.660
Well, thanks.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.200
Oh, have your parents found jobs?

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.120
Yes. I was told there really
are many kinds of jobs in Akiba.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.830
They said the Hometown Clubhouse
was a big help, as well.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.330
I see...

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:31.330
When we come here,
we see many People of the Land

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.160
who moved here from rural areas like us.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.490
There's a dependable advisor, too.

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:39.290
Whoa! You found a job?!

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.700
Rudy's the advisor?

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.370
Here's to the Duke of Akiba!

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.040
Did you hear, Rudy?

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:51.540
The Duke will protect the town of Akiba!

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:52.990
So I heard.

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.580
We can live here without worries now!

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:57.790
Well then, once again...

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.790
Cheers!

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:03.330
Calm down.

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:03.330
By Duke, they mean Eins, right?

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.660
Does it make you that happy?

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.740
It's a duke we're talking about!

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:11.370
It's amazing to be able to live
in a town where a duke lives!

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:14.830
Hmm... I see...

