00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:53.040
This is tasty.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:57.950
Thank you for bringing me such a wonderful gift.

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:01.200
You wanted to know about
the history of Yamato, right?

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.660
Yes, please tell us.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.200
Let's see... Where shall I start?

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:14.500
The Duke of Akiba

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.790
"The Duke of Akiba."

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.160
Six hundred years ago or so,

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:20.240
a unified nation was born
in the Crescent Islands of Yamato.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:23.120
That was the Imperial Dynasty of Westelande.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:28.740
In this imperial dynasty, there were
four families called the Four Duke Families.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:35.330
The Duke of Ninetail Family that ruled Ninetail,
which included a vast granary.

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:40.740
The Duke of Fourland Family that
protected Fourland on the sea of Seto.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:45.620
The Duke of Woodell that owned
a prosperous town named Lande

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.040
instead of owning their own domain.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.660
Lastly, the Duke of Cowen Family
in Maihama, whose appointment

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:56.240
was due to their development
and protection of the eastern land.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:04:01.910
These four Duke Families supported
and developed the imperial dynasty.

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:03.790
That's Rayneshia's family.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:06.660
He said "Dukes..."

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.330
Yeah. Eins is a duke now.

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:13.120
Does that mean he became as
important as Rayneshia's grandfather?

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:17.660
Among the noble titles, it's the highest rank
and they're second only to the king.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:21.160
I-I didn't know... Then this isn't good.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.370
About 370 years ago,

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:27.370
a war against the Alvs,
the indigenous inhabitants, broke out.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:31.490
Yamato was invaded, and the
Duke Families engaged in an uphill battle.

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:34.740
However, in order to protect
their heart, the Lande Territory,

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:40.200
the government of the imperial dynasty
ignored the Dukes' requests for aid.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:45.040
So they abandoned the provinces
in order to defend the capital...

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:49.040
As a result, both the Fourland
and Ninetail territories were destroyed.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:51.740
It also created a deep rift between
the imperial dynasty government

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.120
and the Duke Family in Maihama.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:57.410
If the whole thing had ended there,
it would've been okay, but...

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:58.870
It didn't?

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:05.200
A dungeon was created in Kyo,
the capital city, by the Alvs' curse.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:09.700
Demons were created, and the Imperial King
and his family all died in the battle.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:14.790
The demons somehow got sealed off,
but the dynasty was totally destroyed.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:17.950
Being unable to give up,
the Duke of Woodell and the Senate

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.660
gathered the survivors and resumed
a government in the land of Ikoma.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:25.790
They then ordered all of Yamato
to recover the Lande Territory.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.990
However, the Duke Family
in Maihama didn't respond,

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:32.870
saying that it wasn't an
imperial order by the Imperial King.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:36.330
So the east and the west haven't
been getting along since then?

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:40.490
After that, the Senate
brought in the Saiguu Family from Ise

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:43.490
since they are related by blood
to the last Imperial King.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:48.370
The Saiguu Family is like a cadet branch

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.160
created for a female member
of the king's family,

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.740
who gave up the right to succession
in order to pray to god in heaven.

00:05:54.740 --> 00:06:00.540
Thus, the Imperial Dynasty of Westelande
became the Holy Empire of Westelande.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.540
The Saiguu Family is a close relative
to the Imperial King's family.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:09.700
People of Yamato respect them
and acknowledge their authority.

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:14.040
And that authority appointed
Eins as the Duke of Akiba.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:18.270
Guild Hall: Ten-Seat
Conference Room - Minami

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.490
Give me a report.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:29.910
Now reporting!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:30.950
Now reporting!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:35.790
Well, you're probably aware of this,
but Nureha currently has the advantage,

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:40.580
which means you're at a disadvantage, Intix.
You're on the losing team.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:41.790
Eternal Moth

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:48.490
Nureha started cooperating with Akiba
after the iridescent coma incident.

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:53.240
The rapport approach is
welcomed by many Adventurers.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:57.410
The sadness of Yamato divided
into East and West is indescribable.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:07:01.370
A hero in the east is currently
fighting the darkness of Yamato.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:06.240
Now is the time for us to heal
the long-standing wounds and help him.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:14.160
But it seems about half of
the Senate decided to go against her.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.370
I bet the other half are
just pretending to be cautious.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.200
I'll take care of it.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:22.990
Do you really wanna count on
Plant Hwyaden's money so much like that?

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:25.410
Doesn't Nureha hold the purse strings?

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:29.540
I was the one who single-handedly
managed the guild.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:32.370
That princess doesn't have abilities like that.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:35.290
It appears she at least has charisma.

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:36.790
She's pretty popular.

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:39.490
That's why I picked her up from a sewer.

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:41.910
She's like a sewer rat that bites your hand.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:43.870
Whoa. How bitter.

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:46.290
My next report is on Akiba.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:49.870
It looks like the head of the
Saiguu Family headed out to Akiba.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:52.040
Is it okay to leave it alone?

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:56.290
That's fine, because he's just
a figurehead with no real power.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.080
He's just like Nureha.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.790
Perhaps he's like a bird with
a dream that escaped its birdcage.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.490
How should I know?

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:07.240
I can investigate a lot of things,
but not what's inside someone's head.

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:11.040
I trust your ability to gather information.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.740
Then you remember the
compensation you promised, right?

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:18.410
For today, I'd like to ask two questions.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:22.200
As promised, you can't refuse or lie.

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:26.620
If I think you did, I won't provide you
with any information in the future.

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.450
I promise I won't do either.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:31.080
Then, here's the first question.

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:34.540
Why do you try so hard to plot
on ruling over Yamato?

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:36.740
You're even willing to start a fight over it.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.830
Why did you change so much?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:43.080
I haven't changed at all
from the time we were in Tea Party.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.660
My goal is to stand at the top.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:47.950
What's changed are the rules.

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:49.660
Rules...?

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:52.740
Around that time,
the most worthwhile thing to me

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:56.370
was to stand at the top in raid conquest races.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:09:00.870
The purpose was to ask all the players
how they felt when they lost against

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:06.120
puny amateurs, not even a guild,
they had been looking down on.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.200
"So, how do you feel...

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:12.160
...seeing a difficult raid, an impregnable one
unless it's by a leading guild,

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:15.490
snatched by a puny group from the sidelines

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:19.740
and having your persistent efforts laughed at?"

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:23.200
I was going to ask these questions
after standing at the top

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.620
under the blue sky as far as the eye could see.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.830
But the rules have changed.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:32.410
There's a bigger fight in front of us.

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:36.870
I'm just going to stand
at the top there and ask again...

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.040
"So, how do you feel...

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:42.740
...being trampled upon
by a mere young woman like me

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:45.540
and having something you've cherished

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:49.580
tainted by sludge?"

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:53.660
It's not like that'd bring
Kanami back, you know.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:55.290
It's got nothing to do with her.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.620
Is this woman's alignment
darkness by any chance?

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:04.620
Well, yeah it is, but stay quiet, okay, Gar-tan?

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.830
You're taking me lightly.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.450
But even I get scared of this woman.

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:12.080
Well then, here's the second question.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:17.700
Have you heard of the name, "Jazer"?

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:26.040
Hey, Rudy. People of the Land
looked very happy about the Duke.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.370
What's the deal?

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:37.700
--Sir Saiguu!
--Sir Saiguu!

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:37.700
What's going on?

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:41.290
That crest is... the Saiguu Family's!

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:46.790
Suifuu Mansion - Akiba

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:52.370
That guy... He came during the Libra Festival!

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:56.160
I welcome your arrival, Viscount Malves.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:04.580
My, my... The Duke of Maihama's pride,
the Winter Rose of Eastal...

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:10.240
I appreciate you coming out yourself
to welcome me, Miss Rayneshia.

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:15.870
I humbly beg your pardon for fulfilling
my duty as a messenger from horseback.

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.330
Of course.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:23.040
I, Umoto Arte Malves, hereby deliver
a letter from the Saiguu Family to you.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:26.240
I have a verbal message as well.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:30.410
"All the preparations
for our marriage are in place.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:35.200
Please come to Kyo,
the capital city, with Malves."

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:38.240
Well, you don't have to bring anything with you.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:41.620
Your marriage ceremony and
new residence have been prepared in Kyo.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:44.540
Would one week be sufficient to prepare?

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.490
That's...!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:50.870
I have... duties in this town.
I cannot just abandon them.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.580
Please do not worry.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.870
Sir Touri Saiguu does
give a great deal of thought

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:57.580
to protecting the People of the Land
in this town, too.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:01.040
Hence, he has newly appointed a Duke of Akiba!

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:06.990
From here on, you can
entrust all your duties to Mr. Eins.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.990
Rudy...

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:18.160
A large number of the
People of the Land are naively happy

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:21.200
because there was no noble
in Akiba up until now.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.990
The People of the Land just settled in
and started living here on their own...

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:26.290
You could say that's how it was with them.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:29.080
They think they're refugees.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:31.200
Refugees?

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:35.080
Many villages the
People of the Land live in are poor.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.830
It's not easy to expand fields and orchards.

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:40.790
Setting aside the eldest son in the family,

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:45.240
the only choice the other sons have
is to live by helping the family business.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.040
Women are in a similar situation.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:51.370
Only some women can get married
to the eldest son of a farm.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:55.080
If you have special job abilities,
you can hope to hold a status,

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.870
but if you don't,
you don't have a place in the village.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:00.490
If you don't like it,
you don't have a choice but to leave.

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:04.080
That's why they think they're refugees, huh?

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:07.200
In this town, quests can change your subclass.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:11.080
To the People of the Land,
it's the same as a miracle.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:14.240
To think a farmer can get a subclass
such as a salesclerk or an accountant...

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:13.810
Farmer

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:17.150
"Salesclerk"      "Accountant"
"Doctor"                "Idol"

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:16.660
It really is a wonderful town.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:19.450
But they're still worried.

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:22.910
Refugees are refugees.
You don't know when they'll get kicked out.

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:25.330
It's not gonna happen!

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:30.660
But with the arrival of the Duke of Akiba,
their worries may get eliminated.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.580
More than 80 percent of the
ingredients supplied to the Marine Agency

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:44.370
are from the People of the Land.

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:49.450
To be honest, if they turn their back on us,
we can't keep our business going.

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:54.660
But you're dealing with those
in farm villages and mountains, right?

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:57.370
The name "Duke of Akiba"
alone will probably extend

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:59.700
its power in the surrounding areas.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:00.990
I see.

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:03.450
Akiba is completely dependent

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:06.950
on the suburban farm
villages for fresh food, so...

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:10.910
Are you saying it's possible the
People of the Land may no longer sell us food?!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:15.700
At least Honesty will be in full control
of running the trading counter with them...

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.700
There's that possibility.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:23.160
It means the card Eins
obtained has a pretty nasty power.

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:26.040
That's not the only issue.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.620
According to Mr. Isaac,

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:32.740
this matter is making the nobles
in Maihama cautious like hedgehogs.

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:36.160
They're worried Akiba, who allied
with the League of Freedom Cities Eastal,

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:40.080
might've gone under the umbrella
of the Holy Empire of Westelande.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:41.660
That's...

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:44.240
I think that's rather natural.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:49.700
Noble ranks are given by higher ranked nobles,
often by the Imperial King.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:54.040
So it's the same as a declaration
that they've gone under his control.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:58.080
Since Mr. Isaac said
he'd go see Lord Serjiad to explain,

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.950
I don't think we'll have
trouble immediately, though.

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:03.540
Hey...

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.700
Doesn't it look like we're screwed?

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:11.010
Maihama - Japan Server

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:10.830
What's with that gloomy face?

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:13.740
I always look like this.

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:17.200
You used to pointlessly smile
with a lively face before.

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:20.200
Even I sometimes hate myself, you know!

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:22.540
Although it was tit for tat,

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:26.580
this happened after
I picked a fight with Eins...

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.950
Eins was at fault that time, though.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:32.700
He's a duke. You must know
this could be a big problem.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.700
Wait, you know that, right?
You do know that, don't you?!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.410
Who cares?!

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.950
The Black Sword Knights will side with Maihama.

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:42.870
I also told that to the old man Serjiad.

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.200
What?!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:48.580
In order to show your sincerity,
you need to act quickly.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.700
I wanna look after Itherus too, so...

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.580
Even so...!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:55.580
You were up to something, too, weren't you?

00:15:55.580 --> 00:16:00.200
Wasn't the matter with Eins
also within your expectation?

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:05.330
No way! To begin with,
it wasn't even Eins' idea, right?

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.700
I bet someone instigated him.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.700
Just spit it out.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:13.580
You sent those pale-faced guys
to us for a reason, didn't you?

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:17.620
Oh... those guys we asked you
to let assist the knights' training?

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:22.240
You said they should have some battle
training in order to trade with provinces.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.910
Well... That's...

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:26.290
Ouch!

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:33.580
They are former Honesty members.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:34.790
What?

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:38.200
We brought in those who seemed
to want to leave it... Many of them.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:40.830
Then <i>you</i> started the fight with Eins?!

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:43.620
I said we got those who
only seemed to want to leave!

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:47.490
Besides, if you knew who they were,
you definitely would've refused, right?

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:52.990
That's why we had them join us first
and then sent them to the Black Swords.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:58.240
Participating in the Black Swords' training
alone can make you trustworthy.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:04.540
The People of the Land would say
"wonderful" or "cool" too, you know.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.790
Things like that are important

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:11.950
to those who're in low spirits
and have given up on all sorts of things.

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:18.910
If they try hard even a little,
they should be praised for their efforts.

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:22.870
They need a place like that.

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:24.100
You...

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.200
Hm?

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:28.240
...kinda sound like a Guild Master.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.950
Hey, I don't wanna be told that by a gorilla!

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.990
I may not look it, but I do have many worries.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.040
The matter with the princess, too...

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:36.910
Hm?

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:42.290
Why now...? I'm completely
getting off to a late start.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:45.830
I don't know what's going on,
but now I get that you have lots of worries.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.170
You can go ahead and drink!

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:48.950
I will! You don't have to tell me!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:54.920
Luquenje Hall, Guild Building

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:54.950
Eins. You've become a duke?

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:57.330
Do you get paid well?

00:17:57.330 --> 00:18:00.490
It seems you all know about it.

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:03.830
I've been bestowed the title of duke
by the Saiguu Family who stands

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:06.870
at the top of the People of the Land in Yamato.

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:09.870
Protecting and ruling the
People of the Land in Akiba

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:13.370
and the area within its
10-ri radius are my duties.

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:15.410
"Within its 10-ri radius"?

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:20.160
In the real-world Japan, that'd be
pretty much throughout the Kanto Plain, huh?

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.990
That's a level of power
as strong as the Cowen Family's.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:24.490
So, it's true.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:25.540
What're you up to?

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.290
What're you thinking?

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:31.240
We've turned down the suggestion
by Eastal's Conference of Lords

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:34.700
that we receive a noble title in the past.

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:37.950
And yet... you've accepted the title?

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:41.120
You know what's going to happen, right, Honesty?

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:45.700
Situations change, Marine Agency.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.790
Eins...

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:53.040
He's unusually assertive.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.660
It was right after the Apocalypse.

00:18:55.660 --> 00:19:01.540
So we had to be cautious about
being absorbed by existing powers.

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:07.540
We still do. Why do we need to be
absorbed by an existing power now?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.660
I can say the same to you.

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:15.580
What's our current consumption
situation like in this town?

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:19.410
We depend on the People of the Land
for most of the resource production.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:23.160
Right. We're already absorbed
by the People of the Land's power

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:27.410
in terms of production and consumption.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:32.240
I'm just trying to be at advantage,
even if it's not much.

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:38.040
But you got that duke
title thing from Westelande, right?

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:41.160
Westelande isn't in good terms with Eastal.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:44.450
Aren't we going to be dragged into their fight?

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:50.200
Even if there's a reason, it's not like
we want to willingly kill each other.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:53.450
This is also in order to avoid a fight.

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.540
What do you mean?

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:58.290
I'm sure you've heard this...

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:01.160
Preparations for the marriage
between Sir Touri Saiguu,

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:05.740
the head of the Saiguu Family,
the top of Westelande,

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:08.830
and Princess Rayneshia are in place.

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:12.160
With this, I think they'll start a dialogue.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:16.950
And Westelande will probably agree
that the lords who participate in Eastal

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:21.580
have permanently independent
administrative power.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:26.740
According to sources, I hear the
Duke of Maihama has already agreed to it.

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:29.740
Well, it's true they're discussing it.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:34.410
Princess Rayneshia's marriage
and Eins' duke appointment...

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:38.240
So, this is why I felt the unnaturalness
of these happening at the same time...

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:45.080
Are you saying there's already a consensus
between Eastal and Westelande?

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:49.160
So this means there's no room
for us to be a mediator, huh?

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:53.620
To Eastal, too... I think
Akiba's independence as a buffer area

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:58.450
and the appointment of a duke
there are something they appreciate

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:02.740
because they can obtain peace without effort.

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:08.120
Do you now understand the
merits of accepting the title of duke?

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:11.870
And now, there's something
I'd like to say to you.

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:16.450
The Round Table Conference is autonomous.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:18.700
Hence, it's weak and has limits.

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:21.240
We can reach agreements in meetings,

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:24.120
but they aren't legally enforceable,
so we don't have the right to decide.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:29.830
As it stands, we cannot act
on rapidly changing situations.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:32.450
Eins! Don't tell me...!

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:37.240
I'm going to make a suggestion.
No, I'm going to take action.

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:41.540
By looking back on myself in the past,
I was able to realize I couldn't win your trust,

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:48.540
not because of what I was suggesting,
but because I didn't take action on my own.

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:53.910
Exactly because of that,
I'd like to actively take action this time.

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:58.240
Honesty will secede from
the Round Table Conference.

00:21:58.240 --> 00:22:01.580
And then we'll call for founding a new assembly,

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:04.620
the Akiba Government.

00:22:06.040 --> 00:22:09.540
Akiba... Government...?

00:22:24.540 --> 00:22:26.790
Thank you for coming...

00:22:28.370 --> 00:22:31.160
Mr. Shiroe of Log Horizon.

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:34.740
Thank you for contacting me.

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:39.370
I was thinking I had to talk to you... Eins.

00:24:12.870 --> 00:24:15.290
Shiroe has a talk with Eins.

00:24:15.290 --> 00:24:18.410
The one who awaits him there
is the head of the Saiguu Family,

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:20.950
Utena Itsukinomiya Touri.

00:24:20.950 --> 00:24:24.370
Meanwhile, Rayneshia
isn't in a position to resist her fate

00:24:24.370 --> 00:24:29.240
and Takayama gives her a message from Krusty.

00:24:29.240 --> 00:24:31.910
Next Time: "The Round Table Fractures."

00:24:29.610 --> 00:24:36.990
Next Time

00:24:29.610 --> 00:24:36.990
The Round Table Fractures

00:24:31.910 --> 00:24:34.580
When things go past the
breaking point, rules change.
